  - '{"drone design": "We can use a combination of lightweight materials and advanced
    navigation systems to create a drone that can navigate through tight spaces and
    rubble. We''ll need to experiment with different shapes and sizes to find the
    right balance between maneuverability and stability.", "scavenging techniques":
    "There are many ways to scavenge for resources efficiently. We can use drones
    to scout out areas, identify valuable materials, and even retrieve them without
    putting ourselves at risk.", "blue''s skills": "Blue has a natural talent for
    building and inventing. With some guidance from me, I''m sure he''ll come up
    with something impressive."}'
  - Stability in control systems requires careful consideration of inertial dampening
